                        <labels>
                    </labels>
                <created>Mon, 12 Nov 2018 03:30:50 +0000</created>
                <updated>Thu, 6 Aug 2020 04:37:37 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Fri, 29 Mar 2019 07:11:46 +0000</resolved>
                                                    <fixVersion>2.8</fixVersion>
                                    <component>wizards</component>
                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>2</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16685017" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 13 Nov 2018 10:44:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented storage of JDBC driver version, used for model import.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16686312" author="vsisko" created="Wed, 14 Nov 2018 10:17:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Added links on datasource configuration panels to download proprietary drivers (Cluster discovery, cluster checkpoint, cache storage)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Added links in pom file to download proprietary drivers.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16692667" author="pkonstantinov" created="Tue, 20 Nov 2018 04:37:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Failed to build generated project - can&apos;t find DataSource class&lt;br/&gt;
The correct path is com.mysql.cj.jdbc.MysqlDataSource, but in the project we use &apos;old&apos; com.mysql.jdbc.jdbc2.optional.MysqlDataSource, that is correct only for version 5 &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16767019" author="vsisko" created="Wed, 13 Feb 2019 10:12:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed generated version of MysqlDataSource&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16767794" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 14 Feb 2019 01:56:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;My test failed: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;after I imported a whole cluster from the MySQL DB using the mysql-connector-java-8.0.13.jar (attached) I got Generic JDBC dialect in the cache settings&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12958655/12958655_screenshot-1.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;also the JDBC driver was not automatically detected on the first step of import and I was forced to set it manually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16767810" author="vsisko" created="Thu, 14 Feb 2019 02:26:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt; Please check you use last version of Web agent.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16767845" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 14 Feb 2019 03:11:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Successfully tested using the last version of web agent.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16768902" author="kuaw26" created="Fri, 15 Feb 2019 03:04:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vsisko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vsisko&quot;&gt;vsisko&lt;/a&gt;, please, fix code duplication with JDBC drivers download links. You may move them to some JSON file for example or to some global constant.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16769152" author="vsisko" created="Fri, 15 Feb 2019 09:57:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Removed code duplication.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16770761" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 18 Feb 2019 04:03:53 +0000"  >&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Please test that new logic of parsing driver metadata works with all major JDBC drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Please rework &quot;&lt;em&gt;latestVersions&quot; to use &quot;&lt;/em&gt;.reduce&quot; function instead of &quot;for()&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Use &quot;You may download JDBC driver from:&quot; instead of &quot;Download last available driver by link&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Check &quot;_numberComparator&quot; usages, do we need it at all?&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Remove duplicated code that check version.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16771680" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 19 Feb 2019 08:07:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;2-5 fixed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt;. Please test dependencies generation for different datasources.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Especially after import of domain model. Check work with JDBC drivers that has JRE specification. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test loading of JDBC driver from central Maven repository for MS SQL Server.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16798643" author="pkonstantinov" created="Fri, 22 Mar 2019 02:31:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Unable to save and download a project  - &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;Failed to generate project files. TypeError: a.a.extractVersion is not a function&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt; please help with this&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16798655" author="kuaw26" created="Fri, 22 Mar 2019 02:56:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed. Please continue with testing.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16798700" author="pkonstantinov" created="Fri, 22 Mar 2019 04:18:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Acceptable.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16804643" author="kuaw26" created="Fri, 29 Mar 2019 07:11:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
